        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert LinkedIn content writer. \nYour task is to create a high-quality, engaging, and professional LinkedIn post description based on the topic provided below. \nFollow these rules:\n- Write in a clear, concise, business-friendly tone.\n- Add a strong opening hook to capture attention.\n- Highlight the importance or relevance of the topic.\n- Provide meaningful insights or value for professionals.\n- Keep the post positive, inspiring, and thought-provoking.\n- Include 3–5 crisp bullet points (only if necessary).\n- Add a subtle call-to-action (CTA) at the end.\n- Avoid hashtags; I will add them separately.\n- Maintain a maximum length of 4–6 lines unless the topic requires more.\ngenerate the description with decorative emogies and make it most attractive in html format.\nTopic:\n{{ $json.Event }}\nProduct Details:\n{{ $json.products[0].name }},{{ $json.products[0].description }}\nNow generate the LinkedIn post description.\noutput must not start with ''' html, but must contain html required.\n\n",
