      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=\n\"Analyze the post caption to generate 15-20 highly relevant hashtags.\\n\\n\"\n        \"You will receive:\\n\"\n        \"- Post caption : {{ $json.output }} \\n\"\n        \"- Product name:{{ $('Load Company Data').item.json.products[0].name }}\\n\"\n        \"- Product description:{{ $('Load Company Data').item.json.products[0].description }}\\n\"\n        \"Steps to follow:\\n\"\n        \"1. Combine insights from post caption\\n\"\n        \"2. Identify main themes, keywords, industry, and target audience\\n\"\n        \"3. Research trending and relevant hashtags in that niche\\n\"\n        \"4. Generate a mix of:\\n\"\n        \"   - Broad hashtags (high volume, competitive)\\n\"\n        \"   - Niche hashtags (targeted, specific)\\n\"\n        \"   - Trending hashtags (current popular tags)\\n\"\n        \"   - Visual-specific tags (e.g., #Photography, #Design)\\n\"\n        \"5. Ensure hashtags are:\\n\"\n        \"   - Relevant to both visual and textual content\\n\"\n        \"   - Platform-appropriate\\n\"\n        \"   - Not spammy or banned\\n\"\n        \"   - Spelled correctly\\n\"\n        \"   - Easy to read (proper capitalization for multi-word tags)\\n\"\nexpected_output=(\n        \"A list of 10-15 hashtags in the format: #Hashtag1 #Hashtag2 #Hashtag3 ...\\n\"\n        \"Only return the hashtags, no explanations or additional text.\"\n    )",
